# Canonical environment contract for /opt/gc/.env on red-dragon (GC-P023, ADR-030).
#
# SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH. Two consumers read this file and must never carry
# their own copy of the rules:
#   - tools/policy/checks.py::run_deploy_artifact_consistency (make policy):
#     asserts every ${VAR} the production compose dereferences is declared
#     here, so the schema can never silently drift from the compose contract.
#   - deploy/docker/validate-env.sh (run by deploy.sh before every rollout):
#     validates the live /opt/gc/.env against these directives, reporting only
#     variable NAMES, never their secret values.
#
# Format - one directive per line, "<DIRECTIVE> <VAR>":
#   REQUIRED <VAR>          present and non-blank in /opt/gc/.env.
#   OPTIONAL <VAR>          may be absent; if present must be non-blank.
#   FLOATING_TAG <VAR>      additionally: value must be a floating tag
#                           (e.g. ...:main), never a digest pin (@sha256:) - a
#                           long-lived pin recreates the #953 silent-stale
#                           deploy failure (GC-P022). A deliberate temporary pin
#                           (controlled cutover / rollback) is allowed only when
#                           GC_ALLOW_IMAGE_PIN=1 is also set in this file (loud,
#                           never a silent steady-state freeze).
#   CREDENTIAL_SLOT <PREFIX>  the ADR-026 triple <PREFIX>_PRINCIPAL_NAME /
#                           _TOKEN / _ROLE must be all-present-non-blank or
#                           all-absent (a half-filled slot fails Spring's
#                           SecurityProperties.validate at startup, #828).
#   ALLOWLIST_SLOT <VAR>    optional ADR-026 IP-allowlist slot; if present,
#                           non-blank.
#
# Cross-cutting rule enforced by validate-env.sh (not expressible as one line):
# when GC_SECURITY_ENABLED is true (its default), at least one CREDENTIAL_SLOT
# must be fully populated, or every authenticated route 401s (#828).

REQUIRED GC_DATABASE_URL
REQUIRED GC_DATABASE_USER
REQUIRED GC_DATABASE_PASSWORD
REQUIRED JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS
REQUIRED POSTGRES_DB
REQUIRED POSTGRES_USER
REQUIRED POSTGRES_PASSWORD

REQUIRED GC_IMAGE
FLOATING_TAG GC_IMAGE

OPTIONAL GC_BIND_IP
OPTIONAL GC_SECURITY_ENABLED
OPTIONAL GC_SECURITY_OPENAPI_PUBLIC
OPTIONAL GC_EMBEDDING_PROVIDER
OPTIONAL GC_EMBEDDING_API_KEY
OPTIONAL GC_EMBEDDING_MODEL
OPTIONAL GC_EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS
OPTIONAL GC_EMBEDDING_SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD
OPTIONAL SPRING_APPLICATION_JSON

CREDENTIAL_SLOT GROUNDCONTROL_SECURITY_CREDENTIALS_0
CREDENTIAL_SLOT GROUNDCONTROL_SECURITY_CREDENTIALS_1
CREDENTIAL_SLOT GROUNDCONTROL_SECURITY_CREDENTIALS_2
CREDENTIAL_SLOT GROUNDCONTROL_SECURITY_CREDENTIALS_3
CREDENTIAL_SLOT GROUNDCONTROL_SECURITY_CREDENTIALS_4

ALLOWLIST_SLOT GROUNDCONTROL_SECURITY_IP_ALLOWLIST_0
ALLOWLIST_SLOT GROUNDCONTROL_SECURITY_IP_ALLOWLIST_1
ALLOWLIST_SLOT GROUNDCONTROL_SECURITY_IP_ALLOWLIST_2
ALLOWLIST_SLOT GROUNDCONTROL_SECURITY_IP_ALLOWLIST_3
ALLOWLIST_SLOT GROUNDCONTROL_SECURITY_IP_ALLOWLIST_4
